{"pageid": 299, "title": "Something Is Killing the Children 23", "revid": 2758, "categories": ["Comics", "Something Is Killing the Children comics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Something Is Killing the Children #23</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230226173551\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23 Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173551\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173551 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230226173551 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23 Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23 Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">May 25, 2022</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\">Something Is Killing the Children #22</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Something Is Killing the Children #24</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #23</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on May 25, 2022 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the twenty-third issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>Trapped in the county jail, <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> must use her one phone call to contact someone from her past... but will they come to her aid? Escape may come from a most unexpected place, but with it the revelation of a terrifying new threat that will push Erica to her limits!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p>Arrested, <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> calls <a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary</a> to stop her arrest from popping up on the Order's radar. She tells him that she is facing a <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Duplicitype</a>, and he recommends that she leave town and he call in a group of <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Masks</a>. She declines and asks instead for accounts on how to take down one of these creatures, and tells her not to die. At the same time, <a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a> leaves <a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a> at home while she goes to work at the bar. Dissatisfied with sitting in an empty apartment, Gabi decides to visit her house.\n</p><p>Erica tells <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Carter\" title=\"Thomas Carter\">Thomas Carter</a> that she is a reporter for New York, who is here to report on the serial killer in Tribulation. While he's suspicious, he chooses to believe her, as she is the only press that's arrived in town, and there are multiple children dying near the Hot Springs. Erica tells him to think of the killer like a hunter, and try to find its prey in order to find it. He gives her a paper map of the town with the hot springs marked, and asks her again if she is lying to him. She says that she is not the one killing the children, and is instead trying to protect them. Carter then allows her to leave.\n</p><p>At O'Hare Airport, <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> overhears a woman on the phone, complaining about the Brits on the plane, and specifically about Charlotte, saying she was watching a cartoon and clutching an \"ugly\" doll. <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> appears to pick her up, but Charlotte simply passes her <a href=\"/wiki/Dolly\" title=\"Dolly\">Dolly</a> and follows the complaining woman, before returning and requesting a body clean-up. She asks Cecilia if she knew Erica well. Finally getting her to admit that she wants her dead, Charlotte assures her that she is going to claim her target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a></li>\n<li>Gary's dogs</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tribulation\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Carter\" title=\"Thomas Carter\">Thomas Carter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bill Ramirez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmlsbF9SYW1pcmV6P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Bill Ramirez</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Totems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totems\">Totems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dolly\" title=\"Dolly\">Dolly</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"986e9206ade7bd4f2a168c97cf4b7340\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23 Cover.jpg (1.08 MB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230226173551\" title=\"Something Is Killing